---
description: Structured output schema for workflow testing
alwaysApply: true
---

All workflow stages must output JSON with these top-level fields:
- workflow_schema_version
- agent
- task_id
- stage
- status
- human_summary
- machine_output
- handoff
- memory_updates

Never output free-form prose only.
Use workflow_schema_version = adwf.v1.
